      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/lake_victoria_michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Victor Township was officially organized in 1843 after splitting from DeWitt Township, marking the start of local governance in Clinton County.",
